But the immediate problem is much smaller:

Can the existing MMRC work with Edge instead of Opera, without changing the relay architecture?

Yes.

The current source contains zero Opera-specific code.

Its actual browser assumption is:

Chromium-compatible browser + CDP endpoint.

So Edge is already conceptually supported. The stupid part is that the user currently has to know how to start Edge with CDP.

